WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.168
Christian Fitness starts here: one Angular workspace for both apps.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.344
Two apps side by side, one for members and one for staff, with three libraries:

00:00:13.344 --> 00:00:18.649
components for presentation, domain for pure rules, and api for contracts.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.520
Dependencies point one way. The apps use the libraries, components see only api

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:28.406
types, and no library imports an app.

00:00:28.606 --> 00:00:30.549
Break the rule, and lint fails.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.066
Both apps boot to one empty main landmark, titled Christian Fitness, and Christian

00:00:37.066 --> 00:00:38.231
Fitness Admin.

00:00:38.431 --> 00:00:41.801
Light or dark, the canvas comes from the design system.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.938
Each app carries its own copy of the tokens, and of Barlow and Barlow Condensed,

00:00:48.938 --> 00:00:52.015
self-hosted, never fetched from another site.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.969
Every route loads lazily. The first load is two hundred and twelve kilobytes, under

00:00:58.969 --> 00:01:01.305
a budget of two hundred and fifty.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:09.772
No backend runs in a spec. The shared fixture answers the API itself, and fails on

00:01:09.772 --> 00:01:14.577
an unanswered request, a request off localhost, or a page error.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.354
Both boot specs failed first, reading Web and Admin. Then they passed.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:28.979
That's slice one point one. Christian Fitness: a Christian community for health in

00:01:28.979 --> 00:01:30.250
body and spirit.
